2:T666,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What does it cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Listing is free while Rynet launches. If that ever changes you will hear from us well before, and you decide whether to stay. There is no contract to get out of."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I have to type my cars in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. We load them ourselves, and if your website lists them, Rynet keeps them up to date from there on its own. You never retype a car for us. The one thing we'd ask for is a spreadsheet of any cars that aren't online anywhere."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"We already use AutoTrader and Cars.co.za.","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keep them. Rynet is one more place buyers find you, at no cost to you, and we do the work of getting you there. We never copy your adverts from those sites: we only read your own website, with your permission."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do buyers reach me?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"By WhatsApp or phone, straight from your listing, to the numbers you give us. Rynet does not sit in between or charge for a lead."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who can list on Rynet?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Registered dealerships only, never private sellers. We check every dealership before its cars go live, which is what lets a buyer trust everything on the site."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I leave?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Any time. There is no contract. Send us one message and your showroom comes down."}}]}10:X
